OTOGAKURE — OATH OF SERVICE
To be recited and marked by every operative entering Lord Orochimaru's service | Form OATH

Oath

I, ____________________, of my own will and in full knowledge, bind myself to the Hidden
Sound and to its founder, Lord Orochimaru.

I swear that my strength is his to command.
I swear that my body is his to shape and to use.
I swear that the secrets of this village will die with me before they leave my lips.
I swear obedience to Lord Orochimaru and to those who speak in his name, without question
and without delay.
I renounce all prior village, clan, and loyalty. From this day I am Sound and nothing else.
I accept that there is no leaving this service but by death, and that my death, like my
life, belongs to the cause.

I make this oath knowing what is asked of me, and I make it gladly, for the power I am
given in return.

Sworn this day: ____________
Operative mark: ____________________
Witnessing officer: ____________________
